'<ol>',
'    <li>Use only the placeholders listed below in your template.</li>',
'    <li>Every placeholders in case-sensitive. Use the names exactly as shown.</li>',
'    <li>Wrap the entire template content between the employee loop tags: <strong>{#employee}...{/employee}</strong></li>',
'    <li>Do not modify the place-holder names or add spaces inside the braces.</li>',
'    <li>Any placeholder that does not exist in the list below will not be replaced by APEX Office Print (AOP).</li>',
'</ol>',
'',
'<h4>Available Placeholders</h4>',
'{EMP_CODE}<br>',
'{FIRST_NAME}<br>',
'{LAST_NAME}<br>',
'{FULL_NAME}<br>',
'{EMAIL}<br>',
'{MOBILE}<br>',
'{GENDER}<br>',
